  "Content": {
    "$Comment": "Air phase (AT_Ice_King_Air) extra combat behaviour, plugged into the vanilla Template_Flying_Aggressive hook CombatAdditionalBehaviorComponent. 1) Health regen off once (as the vanilla boss templates). 2) Every 25 s (first after 15 s), while at most 8 Gunters are within 30 blocks (10 with the 2 new ones), summon 2 Gunters: repeating timer + Not Mob sensor + Spawn action, the vanilla Scarak_Broodmother louse pattern. 2026-10-21: circles around the player (AT_CIRCLE, radius 16) instead of hovering over his head.",
    "Continue": true,
    "Sensor": {
      "Type": "Any"
    },
    "Instructions": [
      {
        "$Comment": "2026-10-21: phase-change animation (AT_Ice_King model set PhaseChange, Status slot) once when he reaches combat in this role. The flying template's Alerted state plays a fixed Alerted animation, so the air roles shorten AlertedTime and this one plays right after it. 2026-10-22 (playtest: in phase 2 the laugh played many times a second): an 'Any, Once' sensor here re-arms every time the combat component is entered again, which the flying template does often, so the phase line (and the PhaseChange animation) repeated nonstop. Now guarded by the flag AT_Ice_King_Phase2_Voice: it runs while the flag is not set and sets it, so it plays once per role.",
        "Continue": true,
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "Flag",
          "Name": "AT_Ice_King_Phase2_Voice",
          "Set": false
        },
        "Actions": [
          {
            "Type": "PlayAnimation",
            "Slot": "Status",
            "Animation": "PhaseChange"
          },
          {
            "Type": "PlaySound",
            "SoundEventId": "SFX_AT_Ice_King_VO_Phase2"
          },
          {
            "Type": "TimerStart",
            "Name": "AT_Ice_King_ManyPlayers",
            "StartValueRange": [
              5,
              5
            ],
            "RestartValueRange": [
              90,
              90
            ]
          },
          {
            "Type": "TimerStart",
            "Name": "AT_Ice_King_Air_Retarget",
            "StartValueRange": [
              4,
              4
            ],
            "RestartValueRange": [
              6,
              6
            ]
          },
          {
            "Type": "TimerStart",
            "Name": "AT_Ice_King_Air_Swap",
            "StartValueRange": [
              8,
              12
            ],
            "RestartValueRange": [
              8,
              12
            ]
          },
          {
            "Type": "SetFlag",
            "Name": "AT_Ice_King_Phase2_Voice",
            "SetTo": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "$Comment": "2026-10-22 (playtest: the Gunters and snowmen defend the king like a pack, whoever attacks him, they go after them): on every tick he takes combat damage, store the attacker (Damage sensor TargetSlot, as vanilla Component_Instruction_Void_Anomaly_Death's LastAttacker) and send it as the payload of a 'Flock_Attack' beacon (SendTargetSlot) to the AT_Ice_King_Minions group within 40 blocks. Template_Predator (the henchmen's base) already listens for 'Flock_Attack' while Idle or asleep (TargetSlot LockedTarget, then Combat.Maybe / Alerted) once its FlockArray is set, which the henchmen roles now do. A Beacon to a group, not a flock: flock members cannot hurt each other and an attacker holds fire when a flock friend is in its line (PositionCache.isFriendlyBlockingLineOfSight), so he stays out of their flock.",
        "Continue": true,
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "Damage",
          "Combat": true,
          "TargetSlot": "AT_Ice_King_Attacker"
        },
        "Actions": [
          {
            "Type": "Beacon",
            "Message": "Flock_Attack",
            "Range": 40,
            "TargetGroups": [
              "AT_Ice_King_Minions"
            ],
            "SendTargetSlot": "AT_Ice_King_Attacker"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "$Comment": "2026-10-22 multiplayer (like the Gobliterator spreading its attacks): when hit, the air attacks switch to whoever did the most damage (Damage sensor TargetSlot LockedTarget = DamageData.getMostDamagingAttacker), at most every 6 s (timer first in the And: SensorAnd stops at the first false, so the Damage sensor only rebinds when the timer is done).",
        "Continue": true,
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "And",
          "Sensors": [
            {
              "Type": "Timer",
              "Name": "AT_Ice_King_Air_Retarget",
              "TimeRemainingRange": [
                0,
                0.5
              ]
            },
            {
              "Type": "Damage",
              "Combat": true,
              "TargetSlot": "LockedTarget"
            }
          ]
        },
        "Actions": [
          {
            "Type": "TimerRestart",
            "Name": "AT_Ice_King_Air_Retarget"
          },
          {
            "Type": "TimerRestart",
            "Name": "AT_Ice_King_Air_Swap"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "$Comment": "2026-10-22 multiplayer: every 8-12 s without a damage switch, lock onto the nearest OTHER player within 60 blocks (Player sensor IgnoredTargetSlot LockedTarget + LockOnTarget), so the air phases do not chase one player all fight. Alone, no other player matches and nothing changes.",
        "Continue": true,
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "And",
          "Sensors": [
            {
              "Type": "Timer",
              "Name": "AT_Ice_King_Air_Swap",
