            },
            {
              "Type": "Player",
              "Range": 60,
              "IgnoredTargetSlot": "LockedTarget",
              "LockOnTarget": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "Actions": [
          {
            "Type": "TimerRestart",
            "Name": "AT_Ice_King_Air_Swap"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "$Comment": "2026-10-22 VO_Many_Players (approximation, no sensor tells who hit him): he is hit while 2 or more players are within 24 blocks (Count with IncludeGroups Player, SensorCount.groupListHasPlayer), at most every 90 s (timer AT_Ice_King_ManyPlayers, first possible 5 s into the role).",
